                                "sense_id": "dc9e711b-0ec7-34c8-a4f4-a643b685f9f3",
                                "text": "Dla prawnika, zwłaszcza związanego z pracą w sądownictwie, zaznajomienie się z problematyką semiotyczną wypowiedzi pytajnych ma istotne znaczenie."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f0d583f-8718-4246-81e9-0111fc6b074b",
                        "source_entry_id": "537d94d4-b484-3921-adc7-7fc0fb136fb4",
                        "source_sense_id": "dc9e711b-0ec7-34c8-a4f4-a643b685f9f3",
                        "target_lang_word": "interrogative",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interrogative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a403fd7-0603-3770-8833-31b6eb7b5d25",
                                        "entry_id": "39ee3d97-3a20-3ffa-8d31-a37d0c0484a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Asking or denoting a question."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73b696b5-dfea-490a-b0d5-ed17caf5834c",
                                                "sense_id": "6a403fd7-0603-3770-8833-31b6eb7b5d25",
                                                "text": "an interrogative phrase"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cf732fc-d676-417b-98de-f43fcf177eec",
                                                "sense_id": "6a403fd7-0603-3770-8833-31b6eb7b5d25",
                                                "text": "an interrogative pronoun"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b2f892e-50ae-4f97-98a6-d071fa1a1248",
                                                "sense_id": "6a403fd7-0603-3770-8833-31b6eb7b5d25",
                                                "text": "The regular place of the interrogative word, of whatever kind, is at the beginning of the sentence, or as near it as possible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83de00da-af5d-390a-95ae-706424a9d763",
                                        "entry_id": "39ee3d97-3a20-3ffa-8d31-a37d0c0484a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to inquiry; questioning"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fbecb81-6c60-4218-a02e-82d72d90123e",
                                                "sense_id": "83de00da-af5d-390a-95ae-706424a9d763",
                                                "text": "He took on an interrogative tone of voice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967619cc-e282-4de6-8df5-c0819d8f1036",
                                                "sense_id": "83de00da-af5d-390a-95ae-706424a9d763",
                                                "text": "Thus speaking, the good man regarded his lady with an interrogative look. \"I do n't know, dear!\" she replied kindly, and sighing again."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "interrogative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "622ea059-7f1b-35e3-b594-1167a766637c",
                                        "entry_id": "51906467-b31f-3c6a-b0a0-584880cec608",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A word (pronoun, pronominal adjective, or adverb) implying interrogation, or used for asking a question: why, who, when, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbda6988-c053-3a99-8d77-3934c82ddc0b",
                                        "entry_id": "51906467-b31f-3c6a-b0a0-584880cec608",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of question mark ⟨?⟩."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0f1f5d8-6a1a-4c58-a54e-ce2ddab16bf1",
                                                "sense_id": "dbda6988-c053-3a99-8d77-3934c82ddc0b",
                                                "text": "There be five manner of points and divisions most used among cunning men; the which if they be well used, make the sentence very light and easy to be understood, both to the reader and hearer: and they be these, virgil,—come,—parenthesis,—plain point,—interrogative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7741748a-74fa-45b9-8c40-ec4b5d70665c",
                                                "sense_id": "dbda6988-c053-3a99-8d77-3934c82ddc0b",
                                                "text": "Whoever introduced the several points, it seems that a full-point, a point called come, answering to our colon-point, a point called virgil answering to our comma-point, the parenthesis-points and interrogative-point, were used at the close of the fourteenth, or beginning of the fifteenth century."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d832a660-5509-36e7-b637-ae1ef3462d69",
                                        "entry_id": "51906467-b31f-3c6a-b0a0-584880cec608",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A question; an interrogation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3ee267a-7d1e-429e-9f42-0f34cf1a1b25",
                                                "sense_id": "d832a660-5509-36e7-b637-ae1ef3462d69",
                                                "text": "\"Who are you, sir, and what is your business?\" demanded the Marquis... \"That is a fair interrogative, my lord,\" answered Dalgetty."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcc96003-5ecd-4085-a08e-c46adf4d8bb6",
